# OBS_DIR for compiling the plugin — NOT the installed OBS folder.
#
# Your install at C:\Program Files\obs-studio is a runtime app only
# (bin/data/plugins). It does NOT contain obs.h / obs.lib needed to BUILD plugins.
#
# Put the path to an OBS *source build* or SDK prefix on ONE line below, e.g.:
# C:\src\obs-studio\build
#
# After the plugin is built, install-plugin.bat / build-full.bat copy the DLL into:
#   %AppData%\obs-studio\plugins\omo-connector\
# which the installed OBS at Program Files will load automatically.
#
# Leave this file empty or delete it until you have a real OBS_DIR.
